    "updated_at": "2016-01-04T08:50:33Z",
    "body": "Per the current definition you would get duplicates, but that does not seem to be what browsers do. @bzbarsky, should I just add a statement to exclude duplicates here?\n\nNote that Chrome does not even list the property names for `getOwnPropertyNames()`... Might be a known bug though.\n",
